# An X session on Dolly's display: the Xsdl server, twm managing the
# windows, and three of X's own clients in theirs: a clock, eyes that follow
# the pointer and a terminal with a shell, where imgui-x11 starts Dear ImGui's
# example in a window of its own.
FROM /v0.1.3/Dollyfile-system fa618e171300d079868dfcf6a88bd064bb27e2a1f0fc7935bc925c21ce35746c
INSTALL /v0.1.3/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xorg-server 091b0fc1e694014c6a505cba0bf0ae82dd26eb45816310e9e55a7f7b972da21b
INSTALL /v0.1.3/demos/x11/Dollyfile-twm 7370cab2eb34e9c1730163ce68aee5c58158675494ccda4cae05711a698a7d88
INSTALL /v0.1.3/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xclock ea88180e9945df666ed0532100b3be567da8565e40261c6380fbd91087d1e6b9
INSTALL /v0.1.3/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xeyes daf12692894189119cfbc5ab3acea00685da39ed2ceb53c7bfad45c1a6b65ffd
